o is a 15‑second single‑shot sequence set on a fog‑shrouded ancient path in the netherworld. <Subject 1> and <Subject 2> stand facing each other across the misty path and perform the traditional cupped‑hand gong salute. Slow‑motion effect and soft diffused hazy lighting are applied. <Subject 2> speaks in a calm tone, then <Subject 1> replies gratefully. Subtle breeze ambient sound is present; no background music. All lines are spoken only once without repetition.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): partially_preserved‑ retains Song Tao’s facial features, black top‑knot with sage‑green hairband and sage‑green outer robe; the character stands on the misty path and holds the cupped‑hand salute gesture.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved‑ fully retains Scholar Zhang’s calm facial expression, black top‑knot with wooden hairpin, dark charcoal‑grey wide‑sleeved outer robe, pale teal‑blue cross‑collar robe and teal waist sash from <Picture 2>.\n<Picture 1> (character‑appearance source for <Subject 1>): weak_reference‑ the original studio standing pose and scroll prop are discarded; only facial features and costume settings are inherited.\n<Picture 2> (character‑appearance source for <Subject 2>): weak_reference‑ the original studio background and standing pose are discarded; only facial features and costume settings are inherited.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe video cuts to the pale, dream‑like ancient netherworld path. Thick milky‑white fog billows over the damp stone‑paved road. Silhouettes of withered willow trees and weathered old stone steles on both sides fade deep into mist. The whole scene is bathed in soft diffused silver‑grey hazy light with no harsh sharp shadows.\n[Shot 1] Slow‑paced atmospheric medium‑wide shot.\n<Subject 2> Scholar Zhang stands on the near side of the misty path, dressed in dark charcoal‑grey wide‑sleeved outer robe over pale teal‑blue inner garment with neat black top‑knot fastened by wooden hairpin. A few steps away, partially veiled by drifting thin fog, stands <Subject 1> Song Tao in sage‑green outer robe and cream‑white inner garment with high top‑knot bound by sage‑green hairband, facing Scholar Zhang. The two young scholars both perform traditional cupped‑hand gong salute: right hand resting over left palm, heads slightly bowed with respectful looks.\nThe whole sequence plays in gentle slow‑motion. Fog drifts almost imperceptibly; hems of their robes flutter softly in breeze. After a short pause, <Subject 2> lifts his head and speaks in a composed, mild‑warm young‑male peaceful voice: <d>[Chinese, 00:04‑00:08]我代你守九年人间，你尽你九年孝心。</d>. As he speaks, a light wind blows through mist and tugs the edge of his charcoal‑grey sleeve. Right afterwards <Subject 1> responds with grateful expression: <d>[Chinese, 00:08‑00:10]多谢。</d>. The camera executes slow gentle push‑in movement forward; soft hazy glow wraps both figures. Then <Subject 1> lowers his saluting hands, turns away and walks off, his figure gradually fades and vanishes into thin mist. Finally the frame freezes on <Subject 2>. No repeated dialogue, mouth keeps closed after lines finish.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nSubtle cool breeze persists throughout the misty path, accompanied by faint rustling sound of linen robes and sleeves stirred by wind. Human voices are clear and close to environment with open‑air ethereal texture, without stone‑hall reverberation or echo.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A", 1344, 768, 124, "match"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 1, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "vae", "link": 2, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "audio_vae", "link": 3, "label": "audio_vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "audio_vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_0", "link": 5, "label": "ref_images.ref_image_0", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "ref_image_0"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "ref_images.ref_image_1", "l